/**
 * This outer type represents a namespace for all hyperparameter-related types. Inner types of {@link Hp} can or will
 * be used for determining the behavior of operations on an {@link MlPipelines}
 *
 * @see {@link Hp.SearchSpace}
 * @see {@link Hp.ParamSpace}
 */
abstract type Hp
